  items:
  - id: ambrosiaCake
    name: Ambrosia Cake
    type: consumable
    desc: A morsel of the food of the gods. Restores 50 health. Too much would burn a mortal to ash.
    heal: 50
    mana: 0
    fireDamage: 0
  - id: nectarVial
    name: Vial of Nectar
    type: consumable
    desc: The drink of the Theurgoi. Restores 50 mana. Cold, golden, and faintly humming.
    heal: 0
    mana: 50
    fireDamage: 0
  - id: ambrosiaCake2
    name: Honeyed Ambrosia
    type: consumable
    desc: A richer cake that mends body and spirit at once.
    heal: 30
    mana: 30
    fireDamage: 0
  - id: relicShard
    name: Relic Shard
    type: quest
    desc: A shard of Kassander's godless blade. It hums when the dead draw near.
    heal: 0
    mana: 0
    fireDamage: 0
  - id: asphodel
    name: Asphodel Bloom
    type: quest
    desc: A pale flower of the underworld's meadows. It glows softly and smells of cold stone and rain.
    heal: 0
    mana: 0
    fireDamage: 0
  - id: cinderSigil
    name: Cinder Sigil
    type: relic
    desc: A coal that burns without dying, taken from the Cinder-Maw. +10% fire damage.
    heal: 0
    mana: 0
    fireDamage: 0.1
  - id: goldCoin
    name: Obol
    type: currency
    desc: An old coin for the ferryman. The dead still expect it.
    heal: 0
    mana: 0
    fireDamage: 0
